## 🚀 Vercel部署配置

### 1. vercel.json配置

```json
{
  "framework": "nextjs",
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": ".next",
  "functions": {
    "api/**/*.ts": {
      "maxDuration": 10,
      "memory": 1024
    }
  },
  "regions": ["sfo1"],
  "env": {
    "NODE_ENV": "production"
  }
}
```

### 2. 环境变量配置

```bash
# Vercel Dashboard → Settings → Environment Variables

# Firebase Admin
FIREBASE_ADMIN_PROJECT_ID=
FIREBASE_ADMIN_CLIENT_EMAIL=
FIREBASE_ADMIN_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Firebase Client (公开)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_DATABASE_ID=

# NextAuth
NEXTAUTH_URL=
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=

# Vercel KV (自动添加)
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=
```

